Z||000009||Pontiaddict||10-26-2001||12:24 AM||||Motor City Online is a driving game that is part of the Need for Speed series.<BR>Basically it's set in the 70's and you get to drive your virtual car around and race other people with it for money and stuff.<BR>What makes this game special is that it takes place online where everyone in town is another actual person that is playing the game too.<P>Go to <A HREF="http://www.motorcityonline.com" TARGET=_blank>www.motorcityonline.com</A>  for more info.||||reg||1
